<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/23/01/110" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">23.01.110 Severability of Provisions.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p>(Amended by Ordinance <a href="https://efiles.portlandoregon.gov/record/17087002">191973</a>, effective January 1, 2025.)</p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>If any part or provision of this Chapter, or application thereof to any person or circumstance, is held invalid, the remainder of this Chapter and the application of the provision or part thereof to other persons not similarly situated or to other circumstances will not be affected by it and will continue in full force and effect. &nbsp;To this end, provisions of this Chapter are severable.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-2920bb95963bc4ba28be79d50570ea72be382611afbc09d7e50bc812af2b6ee8">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-b5a9be70a2a6d40584d5e5bd573f0ec38afaeffc4dd22d798068a475e845e8f3">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

