</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-f76c049ca4056526f2fa377445ae9cff1aa22a3c680139d9062dc2d5482d2b9e">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/23/10/100" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">23.10.100  Application.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-prefix-note field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>(Amended by Ordinance </span><a href="https://efiles.portlandoregon.gov/record/17087002">191973</a><span>, effective January 1, 2025.)</span></p></div></div>



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><ol class="code-list"><li>This Chapter is effective immediately for drafting of the administrative rules under Section 23.10.050, contracting with the State of Oregon’s Bureau of Labor and Industries under Subsection 23.10.060 A. and public education and outreach under Section 23.10.080. &nbsp;Enforcement of this Chapter under Subsections 23.10.060 B., C. and D. commenced July 1, 2016.</li></ol></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-a90949e97c93567f1433171cadda77ec0f8907f4103b7bd65c8479e114ce536b">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
